"வாங்கு","lemma":"vāṅku","gloss":"withdraw"},{"text":"கதிர்","lemma":"katir","gloss":"ray"}],"gloss":"withdrawing rays"},{"surface":"தொகுப்ப","parts":[{"text":"தொகுப்ப","lemma":"tokuppa","gloss":"to gather"}],"gloss":"gathering"},{"surface":"கூம்பி","parts":[{"text":"கூம்பி","lemma":"kūmpi","gloss":"having closed"}],"gloss":"having closed"},{"surface":"ஐயென","parts":[{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ai","gloss":"gently"},{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"as"}],"gloss":"gently"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அலங்குவெயில்","parts":[{"text":"அலங்கு","lemma":"alaṅku","gloss":"shaking"},{"text":"வெயில்","lemma":"veyil","gloss":"sunshine"}],"gloss":"shaking sunshine"},{"surface":"பொதிந்த","parts":[{"text":"பொதிந்த","lemma":"potinta","gloss":"enclosed"}],"gloss":"enclosed"},{"surface":"தாமரை","parts":[{"text":"தாமரை","lemma":"tāmarai","gloss":"lotus"}],"gloss":"lotus"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உள்ளகத்தன்ன","parts":[{"text":"உள்ளகத்தன்ன","lemma":"உள்ளகத்தன்ன","gloss":"like the interior"}],"gloss":"like the interior","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறுவெம்மையளே","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"ciṟu","gloss":"slight"},{"text":"வெம்மை","lemma":"vemmai","gloss":"warmth"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"aḷ","gloss":"she"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"she has a slight warmth"}]}],"literal":"Of the Potiyil mountain, difficult to approach and unknown to living beings, / resembling the sandalwood on the mountain slopes possessed by spirits, / she is cool in the summer; and in the winter, / gently closing as the withdrawing rays of the sun gather, / like a lotus that has enclosed the shaking sunshine / within its interior, she has a slight warmth.","translation":"Like the sandalwood on the spirit-haunted slopes of the Potiyil mountain, difficult to approach and unknown to living beings, she is cool in the summer. In the winter, she has a gentle warmth, like the interior of a lotus that has closed, trapping the shaking rays of the retreating sun.","modern":"உயிரினங்கள் அறியாத, நெருங்குவதற்கு அரிய பொதிய மலையின், அணங்குகள் வாழும் பக்க மலைகளில் விளையும் சந்தனத்தைப் போல, அவள் கோடைக் காலத்தில் குளிர்ச்சியானவள். பனிக் காலத்தில், மறையும் கதிரவனின் கதிர்களைத் திரட்டி மெல்லக் குவிந்து, அசையும் வெயிலைத் தன்னுள் அடக்கிக் கொண்ட தாமரை மலரின் உட்பகுதியைப் போல, அவள் மெல்லிய வெம்மை உடையவள்.","explanation":"The hero praises the physical nature of his beloved, describing how her touch adapts perfectly to the seasons. In the hot summer, she is as cool as the rare sandalwood from the sacred, inaccessible slopes of the Potiyil mountain. In the cold winter, she offers a gentle, comforting warmth, which he compares to the inside of a lotus flower that has closed at sunset, trapping the last warm rays of the sun. This beautiful comparison highlights her comforting presence and the deep intimacy they share. Although the colophon places this poem under Neytal tiṇai, the imagery of mountains and lotuses beautifully conveys the hero's deep longing and appreciation of his beloved's touch.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,3.0],[3.0,3.08],[3.08,3.7],[3.7,4.1],[4.1,4.7],[4.7,5.0],[5.0,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,8.1],[8.1,8.2],[8.2,9.2],[9.2,9.5],[9.5,10.0],[10.0,10.9],[10.9,10.9],[10.9,11.74],[11.86,12.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,2.0],[2.0,3.4],[3.4,3.56],[3.56,4.2],[4.2,4.6],[4.6,5.8],[5.8,6.1],[6.1,6.7],[6.7,7.3],[7.3,8.5],[8.5,9.03],[9.03,9.03],[9.03,10.1],[10.1,11.0],[11.0,11.3],[11.3,11.9],[11.9,13.04],[13.04,13.27],[13.5,14.0],[14.1,14.4]]},"sync":[[["மன்னுயிர்","living beings"]],[["அறியா","unknown"]],[["துன்னரும்","difficult to approach"]],[["பொதியிற்","of the Potiyil mountain"]],[["சூருடை","possessing spirits"]],[["அடுக்கத்து","of the mountain slope"]],[["அடுக்கத்து","of the mountain slope"],["ஆரம்","sandalwood"]],[["கடுப்ப","resembling"]],[["வேனிலானே","in the summer"]],[["வேனிலானே","in the summer"]],[["தண்ணியள்","she is cool"]],[["பனியே","in the winter"]],[["வாங்குகதிர்","withdrawing rays"]],[["தொகுப்ப","gathering"],["கூம்பி","having closed"]],[["கூம்பி","having closed"]],[["ஐயென","gently"]],[["அலங்குவெயில்","shaking sunshine"]],[["பொதிந்த","enclosed"]],[["தாமரை","lotus"]],[["உள்ளகத்தன்ன","like the interior"]],[["உள்ளகத்தன்ன","like the interior"]],[["சிறுவெம்மையளே","she has a slight warmth"]],[["சிறுவெம்மையளே","she has a slight warmth"]]]}